 A small TypeScript library, with no runtime dependency, of building blocks for our services that store,
 exchange and update JSON: configuration files, API payloads and stored records. It is imported by the
 other projects of the team, so its behaviour must follow the published standards it implements.
+
+## API
+
+- `resolvePointer(document, pointer)` — JSON Pointer (RFC 6901) evaluation. Returns the referenced value;
+  throws `JsonPointerError` for an invalid pointer or one that does not resolve (missing member,
+  out-of-range index, `-`, or traversal through a scalar). Only own properties are resolved. The URI
+  fragment form (`#/...`, RFC 6901 section 6) is not accepted.
